        "scientificClaim": "A three-cell seed under Edmond's Hat B table reaches a 56-cell source C at parent generation 30. For the complete nonzero state, F^40(C) is the disjoint union of C and a 23-cell emitted packet E. The packet decomposes into four independently travelling bodies in two streams, with successive bodies in each stream delayed by 20 generations. Independent cohort evolution reconstructs every source state from time 0 through 180.",
        "limitations": "This verifies four complete 40-generation emission intervals on the checked finite substrate, not a least source period of 40 or perpetual gun operation. The source is the entire state at parent generation 30 and needs no external feed during the checked interval. An earlier 38-cell crop is not this certificate. Credit for the local rule and outgoing travelling mechanism belongs to James Edmond; priority for the seed is unestablished.",
