        "note": "The initial twelve live-cell coordinates are identical to the packageâ€™s published B2/S35 p5 spaceship phase, but the rule is changed to B235/S134 with 5 states. After 58 generations the seed becomes a period-4 spaceship translating (2,0). Credit Bays and Cerkan for the starting pattern, not for these changed-rule dynamics. The package establishes this particular adaptation and verifies its launch and eventual complete-state recurrence; it does not establish worldwide priority for the launcher or resulting ship.",
