        "preciseClaim": "Under binary B135/S0246 the next state is the XOR of the centre and its six neighbours. At times 2^k the evolution equals the XOR of seven translations of the seed. For this seed these seven copies are disjoint at times 8, 16 and 32, with 21 live cells.",
