  "references": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "text": "Gabbay, Murdoch J. Aperiodic Life, version 3.7.4. Software, curated configurations and computational evidence, 14 October 2026. Catalogue: AI generated following prompts by Murdoch J. Gabbay. Editable catalogue sources and exact-state evidence accompany the release.",
